*.local

# Screenshots and OCR dumps never leave this machine.
screenshots/*
!screenshots/README.md

# Same rule for sample exports. ref/ holds a real ledger — every amount, every
# note, every account name — kept to test the importer against the shape of an
# actual file rather than an imagined one. The shape is worth committing; the
# money is not, so scripts/test-parse.mjs carries an invented copy instead.
ref/*
!ref/README.md

# Working notes — the audit, design specs. Kept local: the audit names the
# weaknesses that are still open (docs/AUDIT.md "Not fixed"), which is a map
# for anyone who finds this repo. Setup lives in SETUP*.md, which is committed.
docs/

.DS_Store
